		(descr "Side-press SMD tactile switch 3.5x7.8x3.8mm with 4 terminals; pads 1.45x1.3mm. Pin 1+2 = top pair, pin 3+4 = bottom pair; pressing connects top pair to bottom pair. For KiCad SW_Push (2-pin) symbol: top pads numbered 1, bottom pads numbered 2.")
